# Generated Roc

**Status:** current.

| Template | Generated |
| --- | --- |
| `<p>…</p>` | `Html.element("p", attrs, children)` |
| void element | `Html.void_element("br", attrs)` |
| static/dynamic attr | `Html.attribute("class", …)` |
| valueless attr | `Html.boolean_attribute("disabled", True)` |
| text | `Html.text(…)` |
| `<>…</>` | `Html.fragment(…)` |
| missing `@else` | `Html.empty` |
| `@for` | `List.map` |
| `<Hello name={x} />` | `hello({ name: x })` |
| Datastar action | `Datastar.post("…")` plus injected import |

Roc type-checking begins after lowering. Source-map segments record ordinary
Roc, signatures, tags, interpolations, directives, and scaffolding.
`rocci inspect` always prints segments.

Golden pair: `test/AllSyntax.rocci` and
`crates/rocci-template/tests/fixtures/all_syntax.roc`.

**Related:** [CLI inspect](/docs/reference/cli/#inspect).
